      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00047",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "Ed: The size of the Pokémon is not the\n",
        "only thing to compare when trying to\f",
        "decide the winner."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00049",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00050",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "Abby: Somebody told me that colorful\n",
        "Pokémon are more likely to win.\f",
        "I wonder if it’s true..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00052",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00053",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "William: I got the Pokémon I wanted,\n",
        "so I’m very happy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00055",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00056",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00057",
      "en_US": [
        "Benny: You know what?\n",
        "I caught a Scyther the other day,\f",
        "and I still didn’t win..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00058",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00059",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00060",
      "en_US": [
        "Barry: You have a better chance to win\n",
        "when your Pokémon is at a high level.\f",
        "But it seems that there is more\f",
        "to winning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00061",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00062",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00063",
      "en_US": [
        "Cindy: I love Bug-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Am I repeating myself?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00064",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00065",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00066",
      "en_US": [
        "Josh: Somebody won the Contest\n",
        "with a Caterpie!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00067",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00068",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00069",
      "en_US": [
        "Samuel: Arrgh! I though it would\n",
        "score higher."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00070",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00071",
