    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00084",
      "en_US": [
        "Bugsy: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "We have a Bug-Catching Contest\f",
        "tomorrow!\r",
        "I have won the Contest many\n",
        "times, so I won’t participate.\r",
        "But you should try it.\f",
        "I’m sure you can win!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00085",
      "en_US": [
        "Bugsy: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "We have a Bug-Catching Contest\f",
        "tomorrow!\r",
        "I have won the Contest many\n",
        "times, so I won’t participate.\r",
        "But you should try it.\n",
        "I’m sure you can win!\r",
        "By the way, will you take a\n",
        "picture with me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00086",
      "en_US": [
        "Bugsy: OK! Let’s take one.\n",
        "Smile!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00087",
      "en_US": "Bugsy: Yay! This is a good one!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00088",
      "en_US": [
        "Bugsy: Oh, I see...\n",
        "That’s OK. I’m not sad."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00089",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00090",
      "en_US": [
        "...\r",
        "This Pokémon seems too shy to respond.\r",
        "Could there be some way of coaxing\n",
        "it into knowing you don’t mean\f",
        "any harm?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00091",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to try playing the\n",
        "Azure Flute? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00092",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} began to play the\n",
        "Azure Flute!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00093",
      "en_US": "Kyuu uuhn.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00094",
      "en_US": [
        "Shaymin responded to the\n",
        "Azure Flute!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00095",
      "en_US": "Shaymin ran off..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00096",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh là là, zese Ouen Starter Pokémon\n",
        "are trés magnifique!\r",
        "Yet, I have but deux of zem...\r",
        "What am I to do..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00097",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! You are le champion, non?\r",
        "Perhaps you have la Ouen Starter\n",
        "I seek?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00098",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon heading your party...\n",
        "It is not the Pokémon that I wanted..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00099",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh là là, that Pokémon heading your\n",
        "party is la Ouen Starter I have\f",
        "been seeking!\r",
        "It looks simply génial with you!\r",
        "Oui, I believe I know what I\n",
        "must do. I shall reunite la \f",
        "Hoenn Starters!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00100",
      "en_US": [
        "Your party... zit is too full\n",
        "for such wonderous Pokémon..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00101",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Torchic{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Mudkip{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from the foreign lady!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00102",
      "en_US": [
        "Merci beaucoup, Trainer!\n",
        "As you say, I bid you adieu!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00103",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Treecko{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Mudkip{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from the foreign lady!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0062_D22R0101_00104",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received {COLOR 2}Treecko{COLOR 0} and {COLOR 2}Torchic{COLOR 0}\n",
        "from the foreign lady!"
      ]
    }
  ]
